  "description": "URL Viewer for Umbraco (16, 17, 18): a backoffice tool in the \"SEO Audit\" section to fetch any URL as Googlebot/Bingbot (or a browser), follow the full redirect chain, view headers and HTML source, and run a static analysis — on-page SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content and accessibility metrics, spam/hidden-CSS/JavaScript detection and cloaking — with a composite SEO score. Also exposes an authenticated API to fetch a URL and return the analysis as JSON. Server-side and SSRF-safe. Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine. (For the site-wide crawler, install uTPro.Feature.SEOAudit.)",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "uTPro.Feature.UrlViewer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-30T06:41:34.027Z",
