  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: Refactored as a dedicated URL Viewer tool. Site-wide crawler and per-node SEO Audit tab moved to the companion uTPro.Feature.SEOAudit package. Engine extracted to T4VN.Seo.Core (shared by both packages). Adds Lighthouse-style composite SEO score (0–100) with per-category sub-scores (SEO / Technical / Content / Accessibility) and individual check pass/fail with remediation advice. Section renamed to match new dedicated role; configuration key changed to uTPro:Feature:UrlViewer.",
